    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2037704531677684034",
      "url": "https://x.com/letspillthetea/status/2037704531677684034",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/letspillthetea/status/2037704531677684034",
      "text": "nagpa gas ako kanina, tapos napa reality check ako bigla, ang mahal na ng gasolina.\n\nat just a few days ago, naka online class ang mga bata dahil sa transport strike, so i had to assist them and decided na mag absent muna. while resting, i was checking the news, and napapaisip ako, ano ba ang gagawin namin? my husband is always flying in and out of metro manila since nasa mindanao ang business namin.. \n\nang dami nang nangyayari sa bansa, at sa atin lahat. ang daming dapat pagtuunan ng oras at isip, pamilya, trabaho, future, stability.\n\nthen i checked x, and bigla tuloy akong naawa.. hala! kay mika parin sila focus? \n\nmika is thriving and happy. sila kaya? when? \n\nla lang. skl",
